<script type="text/javascript">
    // Joyce's pentagon has a random face, which a highlight would raise over
    // the radii (#140), so the prose reaches it through pentT, a faceless
    // twin, as {ABCDE|pentT}; his circle is already faceless and is reached
    // as {ABCDE|circ}. The circle and the five radii are held back until the
    // proof draws them.
    //
    // Angle markers: AFB at the centre; FAB, ABF, FBC at the base (FAB = FBC
